  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Livelihoods, Positive Coping: Overcoming barriers to Yemeni children&#x2019;s wellbeing created by the conflict&#x201d; project in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will deliver improved socio-economic conditions and education access for vulnerable families in Bani Hushaish, Sana&apos;a, who are facing deepening poverty due to the economic impact of Covid-19. A sustainable package of livelihood, child protection and education support will ensure households can meet their basic needs within 18 months and avoid negative coping mechanisms that place their children, and girls in particular, out of school and at risk of early marriage and child labour.</narrative>
  </description>
